Package: com.squ1dd13.cleovc
Name: CLEO VC
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.6000)
Provides: com.squ1dd13.cleovc
Conflicts: com.squ1dd13.cleovc
Replaces: com.squ1dd13.cleovc
Version: 1.0.0-iphone5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: CLEO for GTA:VC iOS (iPhone 5 / ARMv7, iOS 10.3.4, GTA VC 32-bit rootful).
 .
 Features:
  - File support: CSA scripts, CSI scripts, FXT language extensions
  - Mod loading: Archive (.img) file modding, Automatic file replacement
  - Cheat menu
  - 60 FPS
 .
 Changelog (1.0.0-iphone5):
  - Initial port of CLEO for GTA Vice City on iPhone 5 (ARMv7 32-bit, iOS 10.3.4).
  - Rootful jailbreak only (socket-based jailbreaks).
  - Installs to /Library/MobileSubstrate/DynamicLibraries/ (classic rootful path).
  - Compatible with Cydia Substrate 0.9.6301 by saurik.
 .
